{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/loj294r6","slide":2,"text":"The failure mode\nAI can summarize all three sources.\nIt cannot safely decide what becomes a requirement without an explicit authority rule.","textPreview":"The failure mode | AI can summarize all three sources. | It cannot safely decide what becomes a requirement without an explicit authority...","textChars":139,"textLines":3,"bbox":[700,340,500,340]}
