{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/vm5grypc","slide":3,"text":"1  Extract\nGemini returns structured claims, quotes, and proposed scope changes.","textPreview":"1  Extract | Gemini returns structured claims, quotes, and proposed scope changes.","textChars":80,"textLines":2,"bbox":[120,310,380,300]}
