{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/honyt87i","slide":3,"text":"3  Resolve\nThe resolver computes the current BRD from active evidence and events.","textPreview":"3  Resolve | The resolver computes the current BRD from active evidence and events.","textChars":81,"textLines":2,"bbox":[1000,310,380,300]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/apsf6pon","slide":3,"text":"4  Explain\nEvery requirement shows what governed it, what it replaced, and why it disappeared.","textPreview":"4  Explain | Every requirement shows what governed it, what it replaced, and why it disappeared.","textChars":94,"textLines":2,"bbox":[1440,310,360,300]}
{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ofy9wn61","slide":3,"text":"Gemini is an extractor. Authority is decided in application code."}
